Test material only (nothing of this is shipped or committed): the English and
Spanish test recordings were made with the Piper text-to-speech voices
en_US-lessac-medium and es_ES-davefx-medium (https://github.com/rhasspy/piper-voices).
The grammar models compared in ml/README.md (Qwen3-0.6B, Qwen3-1.7B, Granite 4.0
350M; all Apache-2.0) are not used by the app.
The swipe decoder was tuned and tested on the HeliBoard Gesture Data Project
(https://codeberg.org/eclexic/heliboard-gesture-data, CC BY-SA 4.0), which
tools/gesture-eval/run_eval.py downloads and checks by SHA-256; none of that data
is shipped or committed.
